      <p class="saas-legal-kicker">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>
        AI-Sticker-Maker.com collects only the information needed to operate the sticker generator,
        manage accounts, process credits, and improve the service.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="saas-policy-list">
      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Information we process</h2>
        <p>
          We may process prompts, uploaded images, generated sticker results, account details,
          usage events, and technical data such as browser, device, and IP information.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Uploaded images and generated stickers</h2>
